  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STRENGTHENING LONG-TERM PROTECTION OF ELEPHANTS IN SOUTHERN TANZANIA - 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to further enhance long-term security of elephants in the Ruaha-Rungwa ecosystem of Southern Tanzania and thereby help conserve one of East Africas largest elephant populations. The geographic scope of this project covers Ruaha National Park, Rungwa-Kizigo-Muhesi Game Reserves, and MBOMIPA Wildlife Management Area (WMA).</narrative>
  </description>
